    {
      "id": "g09",
      "no": 3,
      "week": 6,
      "emoji": "💲",
      "title": "How much / How many",
      "en": "How much / How many",
      "reuse": null,
      "intro": [
        {
          "h": "問數量同價錢",
          "p": "<b>How much</b> + 不可數名詞（money, water），亦專門用嚟問價錢。<br><b>How many</b> + 可數複數（tickets, apples）。<br>香港買嘢第一句好多時就係 How much is it?",
          "ex": [
            [
              "How much is the ticket?",
              "張票幾多錢？"
            ],
            [
              "How many dollars do you have?",
              "你有幾多蚊？"
            ],
            [
              "How much water do you need?",
              "你需要幾多水？"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "h": "答法小提示",
          "p": "價錢：It is ten dollars.／It costs ten dollars.<br>數量：I need two tickets.<br>記住：much 睇「數唔數得清」；many 睇「可唔可以加 -s」。",
          "ex": [
            [
              "How much does it cost?",
              "幾多錢？"
            ],
            [
              "How many seats do you need?",
              "你要幾多個位？"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
          "t": "mc",
