      "title": "現在進行式 be + -ing",
      "en": "Present continuous: be + -ing",
      "reuse": null,
      "intro": [
        {
          "h": "而家進行緊",
          "p": "<b>am / is / are + 動詞-ing</b> = 說話嗰陣正在做嘅動作。<br>I <b>am</b> charging my phone.<br>She <b>is</b> downloading an app.<br>They <b>are</b> waiting.<br>唔好漏咗 be 動詞（錯：I charging my phone）。",
          "ex": [
            [
              "I am charging my phone.",
              "我喺度充緊電。"
            ],
            [
              "They are watching a video.",
              "佢哋睇緊片。"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "h": "問句",
          "p": "把 be 動詞提前：<b>What are you doing?</b><br>Are you using Wi-Fi? Yes, I am.／No, I'm not.",
          "ex": [
            [
              "Are you using Wi-Fi?",
              "你用緊 Wi-Fi 嗎？"
